{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 26, "ref": "2-kings 17:26", "book": "2-kings", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 17, "translation": "Lalu kata mereka kepada raja Assur: \"Bangsa-bangsa yang tuanku telah buang dan yang tuanku tempatkan di bandar-bandar Syomeron tidak mengenali ⟨את⟩ hukum Elohim negeri ini, maka Elohin menghantarkan di tengah-tengah mereka ⟨את⟩ singa-singa, dan lihat, ⟨את⟩ singa-singa itu membunuh mereka, kerana mereka tidak mengenali ⟨את⟩ hukum Elohim negeri ini.\"", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויאמרו", "gloss": "lalu kata mereka"}, {"surface": "למלך", "gloss": "kepada raja"}, {"surface": "אשור", "gloss": "Assur"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "demikian"}, {"surface": "הגוים", "gloss": "bangsa-bangsa"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "yang"}, {"surface": "הגלית", "gloss": "tuan telah buang"}, {"surface": "ותושב", "gloss": "dan tuan tempatkan"}, {"surface": "בערי", "gloss": "di bandar-bandar"}, {"surface": "שמרון", "gloss": "Syomeron"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "tidak"}, {"surface": "ידעו", "gloss": "mengenali"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "hukum"}, {"surface": "משפט", "gloss": "hukum"}, {"surface": "אלהי", "gloss": "Elohim"}, {"surface": "הארץ", "gloss": "negeri ini"}, {"surface": "וישלח", "gloss": "maka Ia menghantarkan"}, {"surface": "בם", "gloss": "di tengah-tengah mereka"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "singa-singa"}, {"surface": "האריות", "gloss": "singa-singa"}, {"surface": "והנם", "gloss": "dan lihat"}, {"surface": "ממיתים", "gloss": "membunuh"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ mereka"}, {"surface": "כאשר", "gloss": "kerana"}, {"surface": "אינם", "gloss": "tidak"}, {"surface": "ידעים", "gloss": "mengenali"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "hukum"}, {"surface": "משפט", "gloss": "hukum"}, {"surface": "אלהי", "gloss": "Elohim"}, {"surface": "הארץ", "gloss": "negeri ini"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T12:49:47.790590482Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}